            "heading": "Juslyn’s Story",
            "index": 4,
            "nearby": "Juslyn’s Story Juslyn Manalo is a lifelong North County resident, daughter of immigrants, and a proven leader who has spent her career fighting for the community that raised her. From growing up in Daly City public schools to raising her own family here, Juslyn understands the challenges working families face, from the rising cost of housing to protecting quality healthcare and creating good-paying jobs. Juslyn is running for Supervisor because she wants every family to have the same opportunity to build a life in District 5 that her family did. She'll bring people together to tackle our biggest challenges so North County remains a place where families can put down roots and thrive. Learn more",
