        "text": "0\nSkip to Content\nEnglish\nDonate\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nEnglish\nDonate\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n# Join Our\nCampaign\nNewsletter Block\nThis newsletter signup form needs a storage option. Edit the block and enter a storage location via the Storage tab.\n# Donate to\nHelp Juslyn Win\nHelp Juslyn keep District 5 a place where families can afford to stay and thrive.\n$25\n$50\n$100\n$250\n$1,000\nOTHER\n# Juslyn’s Story\nJuslyn Manalo is a lifelong North County resident, daughter of immigrants, and a proven leader who has spent her career fighting for the community that raised her.\nFrom growing up in Daly City public schools to raising her own family here, Juslyn understands the challenges working families face, from the rising cost of housing to protecting quality healthcare and creating good-paying jobs.\nJuslyn is running for Supervisor because she wants every family to have the same opportunity to build a life in District 5 that her family did. She'll bring people together to tackle our biggest challenges so North County remains a place where families can put down roots and thrive.\nLearn more\n# Issues\n# Volunteer\nTop",
